{
  "id": "qa-gate-deliverable",
  "name": "qa_gate_deliverable",
  "description": "The shippability check for ko_imaging_deliverable. Runs the whole detector family — hard rules + hygiene, SNOMED is-a consistency, contrast fidelity, transliteration — and aggregates them into one verdict and one prioritised worklist. Re-runnable against whatever the deliverable currently is, because it reads the named data object rather than a run-specific path. This is also the mandatory 'after' check for any repair: a repair is optimised against ONE detector, so accepting it on that detector's own evidence is circular. Acceptance must be Pareto — clear the target defect, introduce nothing new on any other axis. Includes the duplicate-translation detector: a collision is a property of a PAIR, so no single-row check can see it, and the 22 in this batch include three clinical errors (ureterography as urethrography, MR angiography as CT, rib as bone) that every other detector passed.",
  "project": "translation_prompt_context_v1",
